1
00:00:00,730 --> 00:00:02,560
(Penny:)Oh, hey, I was
just on my way to work.

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,030
(Leonard:)Oh, okay,
its not important.

3
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:05,000
(Leonard:)It can wait.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,620
(Penny:)No, it's all right.
Walk me down.

5
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:07,620
(Leonard:)So, what's up?

6
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,300
(Leonard:)Uh, I kind of have
a problem

7
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,310
(Leonard:)I was hoping
you could help me with.

8
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:12,370
(Penny:)Sure, anything.

9
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:14,880
(Leonard:)Move out.

10
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,240
(Penny:)What?

11
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,580
(Leonard:)Not far.

12
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,650
(Leonard:)Hey, if you ever wanna
start a family,

13
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,500
La Cañada has
some great schools.

14
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,920
(Penny:)Okay, I'm not
moving anywhere.

15
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:25,050
(Penny:)What the hell
is this all about?

16
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:27,620
(Leonard:)Why does it have
to be about anything?

17
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,720
(Leonard:)Can't a fella ask
his buddy to relocate,

18
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,830
(Leonard:)no questions asked?

19
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:33,230
(Penny:)Oh, for God's sake,
Leonard,

20
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:34,730
(Penny:)this is about Priya,
isn't it?

21
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:36,460
(Penny:)She doesn't want me
hanging out with you.

22
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:39,630
(Leonard:)Yes. There, I said it.

23
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,440
(Penny:)Okay, look.

24
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:44,600
(Penny:)I happen to like
your girlfriend.

25
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:45,520
(Leonard:)And she likes you.

26
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,170
(Penny:)No, she doesn't.

27
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:47,910
(Leonard:)Not really, no.

28
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:49,840
(Penny:)It doesn't matter.
Look, I promise from now on

29
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,310
(Penny:)I will keep
my distance from you.

30
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:53,710
(Leonard:)Well, now, hold on.
What kind of distance

31
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,650
(Leonard:)are we talking about?
Because we are neighbors.

32
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:57,950
(Leonard:)I mean, I can hear the toilet
flush in your apartment.

33
00:00:57,950 --> 00:01:00,590
(Penny:)You can hear my toilet flush?

